  "releaseNotes": "v5.3.1: on SpawnDev.ILGPU 5.3.1. TRIM SAFE, enforced: IsTrimmable, all JSON source-generated (output parity with the reflection serializer proven); the full test suite passes on a TRIMMED publish; Blazor WASM AOT supported with WasmStripILAfterAOT=false. ReduceL1/L2/SumSquare/LogSum/LogSumExp fixed as a family; stream loads accept optimizer-folded constants; no-readback GPU depth (EstimateGpuRawAsync) for per-frame consumers; warm folded forwards skip folded nodes.",
